{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41341","headline":"荆南席上咏胡琴妓二首 二 · 王仁裕","name":"荆南席上咏胡琴妓二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉纤挑落折冰声，散入秋空韵转清。\n二五指中句塞雁，十三弦上啭春莺。\n谱从陶室偷将妙，曲向秦楼写得成。\n无限细腰宫里女，就中偏惬楚王情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}